  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(p - q) = - 6, (q - r) = 5 and (r - p) = 1\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(p3 + q3 + r3 - 3pqr) = 1/2 × (p + q + r) [(p - q)² + (q - r)² + (r - p)²]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(p3 + q3 + r3 - 3pqr) = 1/2 × (p + q + r) [(p - q)2 + (q - r)2 + (r - p)2]\n\n⇒ (p3 + q3 + r3 - 3pqr) / (p + q + r) = 1/2 × [(-6)2 + (5)2 + (1)2]\n\n⇒ (p3 + q3 + r3 - 3pqr) / (p + q + r) = 1/2 × [36 + 25 + 1]\n\n⇒ (p3 + q3 + r3 - 3pqr) / (p + q + r) = 1/2 × 62 \n\n⇒ (p3 + q3 + r3 - 3pqr) / (p + q + r) = 31\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
